  "steps": [
    "Roast bell peppers, garlic cloves, onion, and pumpkin by coating them with olive oil and salt. Roast in an oven at 190 degrees for 25-30 mins or in airfryer at 190 degrees for 15-20 mins. The pumpkin should be golden brown and tender and the bell pepper skin should be slightly charred.",
    "Let this cool down and blend the veggies with tofu and 200-300 ml water until smooth.",
    "In a pan, add butter, pepper and chilli oil. Sauté for a minute and add the mixture.",
    "Let it come to a boil and then add coconut milk and sweetner along with basil leaves.",
    "Add more water if needed to achieve desired consistency. Cover and let it cook for 10-12 mins.",
    "Garnish with chilli oil, melted butter and pumpkin seeds."
  ],
